{"id":"08afaae97db1d476","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-fo-turing-reduction.md","title":"一阶Turing归约","display":"df-fo-turing-reduction — 一阶Turing归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-fo-turing-reduction","aliases":["29-df-fo-turing-reduction"],"display":"df-fo-turing-reduction — 一阶Turing归约","depends_on":["[[29-df-generalized-quantifier]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]","[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","[[29-df-fo-query]]"],"source_locator":"Definition11.21, p.178, DjVu scan193","source_basis":"扫描193原图及定义已对照；查询按词汇加标签，保留合法论域参数","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-fo-turing-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-fo-turing-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fo-turing-reduction — 一阶Turing归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10608c2a55a773a6\" href=\"?note=10608c2a55a773a6\" title=\"29-df-generalized-quantifier\">29-df-generalized-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition11.21, p.178, DjVu scan193"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描193原图及定义已对照；查询按词汇加标签，保留合法论域参数"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}\\)</span> 与广义量词逻辑沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"10608c2a55a773a6\" href=\"?note=10608c2a55a773a6\" title=\"29-df-generalized-quantifier\">29-df-generalized-quantifier</a>。所有对象为元语言中的查询类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75340800e8905793\" href=\"?note=75340800e8905793\" title=\"29-df-fo-query\">29-df-fo-query</a>；下式使用带词汇标签的查询，避免不同词汇的空模型集被混同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\)</span> 遍历下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\">\\(\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)\">\\(\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 使用上游的递归定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,A)\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ A\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\sigma,\\ \\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\cong N\\to(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow N\\in A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,A)\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ A\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\sigma,\\ \\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\cong N\\to(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow N\\in A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\sigma,\\{M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\mid M\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\phi\\}\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\sigma,\\{M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\mid M\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\phi\\}\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\;(I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow I(M)\\in B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\;(I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow I(M)\\in B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOTClosed}_{\\mathfrak D}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\subseteq\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf b\\in C\\land\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b)\\to\\mathbf a\\in C\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FOTClosed}_{\\mathfrak D}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\subseteq\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf b\\in C\\land\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b)\\to\\mathbf a\\in C\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一阶Turing归约允许量词嵌套、布尔运算和反复调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_B\">\\(Q_B\\)</span>。一阶多一归约只用一次FO解释，再询问输出是否属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；上式保留不同记号。本库原有无标签归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a>，此处是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak D\">\\(\\mathfrak D\\)</span> 后的显式词汇标签版本。Turing闭包是后续完全性命题的必要假设；不能仅凭NP对一阶多一归约封闭就宣称NP满足它。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-generalized-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-generalized-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-generalized-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}$ 与广义量词逻辑沿用 [[29-df-generalized-quantifier]]。所有对象为元语言中的查询类。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-query","status":"resolved","id":"75340800e8905793","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]；下式使用带词汇标签的查询，避免不同词汇的空模型集被混同。$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b$ 遍历下式 $\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一阶Turing归约允许量词嵌套、布尔运算和反复调用 $Q_B$。一阶多一归约只用一次FO解释，再询问输出是否属于 $B$；上式保留不同记号。本库原有无标签归约见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]，此处是固定 $\\mathfrak D$ 后的显式词汇标签版本。Turing闭包是后续完全性命题的必要假设；不能仅凭NP对一阶多一归约封闭就宣称NP满足它。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V,\\mathfrak D=(\\mathcal D_\\sigma)_{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,A)\\mid\\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ A\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\sigma,\\ \\forall M,N\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\cong N\\to(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow N\\in A))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(\\sigma,\\{M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\mid M\\models_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}\\phi\\}\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathcal V,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\mathbf b}),\\mathfrak D}[\\sigma]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf b,\\mathfrak D}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a=(\\sigma,A)\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}\\mathbf b=(\\tau,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\;(I[\\mathcal D_\\sigma]\\subseteq\\mathcal D_\\tau\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal D_\\sigma\\;(M\\in A\\leftrightarrow I(M)\\in B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOTClosed}_{\\mathfrak D}(C)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ C\\subseteq\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf b\\in C\\land\\mathbf a\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}\\mathbf b)\\to\\mathbf a\\in C\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"Q_B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak D","display":false}],"bytes":3030,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca9dcc9ec1866c06","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-generalized-quantifier]]、[[29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]、[[29-df-generalized-quantifier-normal-form]]、[[29-thm-generalized-quantifier-completeness]] — 合法解释、嵌套调用、范式与完全性"},{"id":"3a9398f013444350","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[29-df-fo-turing-reduction]] 的 $\\mathfrak D,\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D},\\mathcal G_{\\mathbf s,\\mathfrak D},\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{fo},\\mathfrak D}^{T}$ 及闭包谓词。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-turing-reduction|29-df-fo-turing-reduction]]"}],"outgoing":["10608c2a55a773a6","92256ad8556a5baf","65b448b4269ca18e","75340800e8905793"]}